{"kind":"artifact","text":"Merged at d93379c2: the ambient adjunct at cmd/gitseq-mcp. Every tool call returns the exact room it acted in, and the adjunct reads that room and no other, so a call can never be answered with another workroom's addressed inbox or leased focus. Durable identifiers are extracted from the call's arguments and result only when they stand as whole tokens: one shared character class bounds both ends, so a canonical identifier inside a longer token is not a mention. The adjunct rides beside the result as a sibling of structuredContent, never wrapping it, and degrades to available:false rather than failing the call.","body":{"commit":"d93379c29a480af2e0981834d81ba020de5192f0","path":"cmd/gitseq-mcp"}}